      "message": "test(post): post program_units' goldens as real programs; no silent skips\n\nprogram_units.rs (new on main with #902) posted the bare legacy goldens.\nAfter the #1357 merge every cycle post refuses drill_peck's unfed G73 and\nTormach refuses every bare stream (no spindle), and the test skipped any\nrefused golden - so its inch comparison and committed inch goldens were\nsilently not checked. The inch-post test now posts as_program streams\nand asserts every golden posts; the grbl family posts each cycle's own\nchain feed; the rotary streams state a spindle speed.\n\nRegenerated inch goldens (only additions, plus the G73 F word main's\ninch goldens lacked): fanuc, haas, mazak, sinumerik, doosan-dnm and\ntormach contour_plate_with_hole and drill_peck under golden/nc/inch/.\n\nRefs #1357\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
